      "description": "11 physical material samples (0.4m x 0.4m) presented vertically at eye-height in white mdf-cases. This included 6 original building materials (blue stone, brickwork, concrete, white plaster, steel, wood) and 5 colored plaster control samples matching the colors of the original materials.",
